        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000255"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cell of an endocrine gland, ductless glands that secrete substances which are released directly into the circulation and which influence metabolism and other body functions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
